# Local values for the development setup. Copy to docker/.env (not versioned) and uncomment what you change:
#   cp docker/.env.example docker/.env
#
# Read by docker compose (docker/docker-compose.yml), docker/build.sh (which passes every X2_* variable to the build
# container), docker/mssql/restore.sh and tools/win/winbuild.sh. A variable set in the shell wins over this file.
# The CMake ones take effect at the next configure (docker/build.sh cmake --preset <preset>) and then stay in the
# preset's cache; an empty value is ignored. Plain KEY=VALUE lines: no quotes, no `export`. The values shown are the
# defaults. Relative paths are taken from the repository root.
# Details: docs/ferramentas/banco-dev.md, docs/ferramentas/runtime.md, docs/ferramentas/ambiente-build.md.

# --- SQL Server of development (docker compose, restore.sh and the .dsn of the server folders) ---
# sa password. The container only takes it when its volume is created: to change it later,
# `docker compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml down -v` and restore the databases again.
#X2_DB_PASSWORD=X2dev!Passw0rd
# Port on 127.0.0.1. The server folders use 127.0.0.1,<port> unless X2_RUN_DB_SERVER is set.
#X2_DB_PORT=1433
# Address the servers announce (SetLocalIP), written by restore.sh to LServerList/LChannelList: the address the
# client connects to.
#X2_SERVER_IP=127.0.0.1

# --- Server folders (build/<preset>/run, CMake) ---
# SQL Server (host,port) and user of the .dsn files
#X2_RUN_DB_SERVER=127.0.0.1,1433
#X2_RUN_DB_USER=sa
# ODBC driver and options. Default: FreeTDS if found (TDS_Version=7.4;ClientCharset=UTF-8), else ODBC Driver 18
# (Encrypt=yes;TrustServerCertificate=yes). To run the folders on the host instead of the container, point to the
# host's driver, e.g. /usr/lib/libtdsodbc.so on Arch.
#X2_RUN_ODBC_DRIVER=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/odbc/libtdsodbc.so
#X2_RUN_ODBC_OPTIONS=TDS_Version=7.4;ClientCharset=UTF-8
# EPublisherServer port and the URL the other servers call (the URL keeps its value if only the port changes later)
#X2_RUN_EPUBLISHER_PORT=8000
#X2_RUN_EPUBLISHER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/
# Client data folder (data*.kom) the ClientScript folder is generated from
#X2_CLIENT_DATA=_client/data
# Where the folders are assembled. Default: build/<preset>/run; set here, every preset uses the same folder.
#X2_RUN_DIR=build/linux-debug/run

# --- Tests ---
# ODBC connection string (without DATABASE) that enables the db suite of x2_server_common_tests
#X2_TEST_ODBC=DRIVER=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/odbc/libtdsodbc.so;SERVER=127.0.0.1,1433;UID=sa;PWD=X2dev!Passw0rd;TDS_Version=7.4;ClientCharset=UTF-8

# --- Build container (docker/build.sh) ---
#X2_BUILD_IMAGE=x2-build
# HOME of the container (ccache cache), absolute path (`~` is not expanded)
#X2_BUILD_HOME=/home/user/.cache/x2-build

# --- Windows test machine (tools/win/winbuild.sh) ---
#X2_WIN_HOST=user@host
#X2_WIN_DIR=C:/x2
